Description: Video and audio playout for gyms and fitness studios
 Bobine plays planned classes on the studio screen, offers a self-service
 cinema kiosk and background radio, and is driven from a phone or a browser
 on the local network. Everything runs on site: no subscription, no cloud.
 .
 Main features:
  - wired HDMI output and an independent network screen, kept in sync;
  - class schedule with one-off and recurring sessions, playlists, subtitles
    and chapters;
  - coach mode with a timer and animated backgrounds;
  - background radio with crossfade and voice announcements;
  - mobile remote control and web administration;
  - backup, restore and factory reset.
